      "scene": 4,
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "emotion": "紧张",
      "text": "不是一盏一盏地灭，是一整排一起灭，像有人一口把它们吸了进去。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "params": {
        "rate": "+1%",
